"There is not enough space to stream this video, even with limited storage. Please clear at least %@ and try again." = "Não há espaço suficiente para reproduzir este vídeo, nem mesmo com armazenamento limitado. Limpe pelo menos %1$@ e tente novamente.";

/* A stream cannot start: the same torrent is already streamed (in a way that cannot be shared) or downloaded. */
"This video is already being played or downloaded. Stop the other playback or the download, then try again." = "Este vídeo já está sendo reproduzido ou baixado. Pare a outra reprodução ou o download e tente novamente.";

/* A stream that was reading the file of an offline download of the same torrent stops: the download was stopped before the file was complete. */
"This video was playing from its download, and the download was stopped." = "Este vídeo estava sendo reproduzido a partir do download, e o download foi interrompido.";
